ight: 62px\">\n<td style=\"width: 52.7719%;text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Official Website</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 46.3311%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"UPSSSC Official Website\" href=\"https://upsssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>UPSSSC Official Website</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<div>\n\n<!-- Internal_header_07-11-2024 -->\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6da1cb96\">\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-325acb59\"><span class=\"gb-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"gb-headline-text\"><strong><em>Frequently Asked Questions</em></strong></span></h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-97950a91 gb-headline-text\"><h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1nlecbm\" data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"96\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">1. UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Main Examination Online Form Start Date?</span></span></strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"178\">The online application process started on <strong>27 July&nbsp;2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1e84k3r\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"474\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>2. UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Main Exam Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\">The Examination will be conducted in <strong>As per Schedule</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>3. Where can I find the syllabus for the UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Main Examination 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The detailed syllabus and examination scheme for the UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Main Examination are available in the official notification. Candidates are advised to read the notification carefully for complete syllabus details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>4. UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Main Examination Notification PDF?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can download the notification through SarkariResult.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>5. UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Main Recruitment Last Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>24 August 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>6. What is the last date to Update application fee Details?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">24 August 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>7. How can I apply for UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Main Exam 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong></strong>\n<p></p><figure id=\"attachment_27456\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-27456\" style=\"width: 2550px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-27456\" title=\"UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Main Examination 2026\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/UPSSSC-1-scaled.png\" alt=\"UPSSSC\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1483\" srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/UPSSSC-1-scaled.png 2560w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/UPSSSC-1-300x174.png 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/UPSSSC-1-1024x593.png 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/UPSSSC-1-768x445.png 768w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/UPSSSC-1-1536x890.png 1536w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/UPSSSC-1-2048x1186.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\"><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-27456\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Main Examination Online Form 2026<span style=\"font-size: 17px\">.</span></figcaption></figure></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Main Pajes 2 -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
